4. DATASETS -- NOT REDISTRIBUTED
   No dataset images or original annotation files are included. The derived
   ground-truth JSONs in artefacts/coco_gt/ and the split lists in splits/
   contain only image file names, image sizes and box coordinates re-encoded
   from the public annotations. Obtain each dataset from its source under its
   own terms:
   - D-Fire: CC0 1.0 (github.com/gaia-solutions-on-demand/DFireDataset)
   - Pyro-SDIS: Apache-2.0 / CC-BY (Hugging Face pyronear/pyro-sdis)
   - Roboflow "final-fire-project" (brac-university-uuemy): Public Domain
   - HPWREN FIgLib: per HPWREN credit terms. FIgLib imagery: High Performance
     Wireless Research and Education Network (HPWREN), University of
     California San Diego, https://www.hpwren.ucsd.edu/
